 display: block; text-align: left; width: auto;\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\"></p><h1 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-size: 2em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\" dir=\"ltr\"></strong><br></h1><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">Embedding the Prospecting Tool Widget into your website can significantly enhance your lead generation efforts by providing visitors with an intuitive and powerful tool for exploring business opportunities. By following these steps, you can seamlessly integrate the widget and start capturing more leads from your site. If you encounter any issues or need further assistance, please reach out to our support team.</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000005546-how-to-place-a-test-order-in-your-ecommerce-store-", "title": "\u2705 When Should You Use a Test Order?", "folder": "Ecommerce", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048466594/original/tiiprYrFxqv_jiqY5lHhgUmlxmL9SurGhA6790.png?1750245589"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\">Placing a test order is essential to verify that your checkout process, payment integration, shipping calculations, and order confirmation workflows are working as expected\u2014<strong>without charging a real payment method</strong>.</p><p>This guide walks you through the steps to simulate a complete order cycle.</p><hr><h2>\u2705 When Should You Use a Test Order?</h2><ul><li><p>Before launching your store to the public.</p></li><li><p>After changing payment/shipping settings.</p></li><li><p>To test the user experience from product selection to order confirmation.</p></li><li><p>To confirm email/SMS notifications for customers and admins.</p></li></ul><hr><h2>?\ufe0f Step-by-Step: Placing a Test Order</h2><h3><strong dir=\"ltr\">1. Enable \u201cTest Mode\u201d</strong></h3><blockquote><p><em dir=\"ltr\"><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155048466594/original/tiiprYrFxqv_jiqY5lHhgUmlxmL9SurGhA6790.png?1750245589\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155048466594\"></em></p></blockquote><p><strong dir=\"ltr\">Using Test Gateway&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li><p dir=\"ltr\">Go to <strong dir=\"ltr\">Sites &gt; Stores &gt; Select Store &gt;&nbsp;</strong><strong dir=\"ltr\">Store Settings &gt; Payment Mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p dir=\"ltr\">Toggle <strong>Test Mode</strong> on.</p></li><li><p>Save changes.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>2. Add Items to Cart</strong></h3><ul><li><p dir=\"ltr\">Navigate to your <strong>live store frontend</strong>. Preview you final Store.</p></li><li><p>Add any product(s) to the cart.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>3. Proceed to Checkout</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Fill out shipping and customer information as if you were a real customer.</p></li><li><p>Ensure address fields, taxes, and shipping options appear correctly.</p></li></ul><h3><strong>4. Use Test Payment Details</strong></h3><p>If you\u2019ve enabled Test Mode, use one of the following <strong>dummy card numbers</strong> (if supported by your platform):</p><table><thead><tr><th>Card Type</th><th>Number</th><th>Expiry</th><th>CVV</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Visa</td><td><code>4242 4242 4242 4242</code></td><td>Any future date</td><td>Any 3 digits</td></tr><tr><td>Mastercard</td><td><code>5555 5555 5555 4444</code></td><td>Any future date</td><td>Any 3 digits</td></tr></tbody></table><blockquote><p>? <em>These numbers won't charge anything but will trigger the full checkout flow.</em></p></blockquote><h3><strong>5. Confirm Order</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Complete the order and check that:</p><ul><li><p dir=\"ltr\">The order shows up in the <strong>Payments &gt;&nbsp;</strong><strong dir=\"ltr\">Orders</strong>.</p></li><li><p dir=\"ltr\">You receive the appropriate confirmation emails/SMS. Make sure you have enabled notifications in <strong dir=\"ltr\">Payments &gt; Settings &gt; Notifications</strong></p></li><li><p>The order status (e.g., pending, fulfilled) behaves as expected.</p></li></ul></li></ul><hr><h2>? Repeat with Different Scenarios (Optional)</h2><p>To ensure full coverage, try test orders with:</p><ul><li><p>Different shipping methods or locations.</p></li><li><p>Discount codes.</p></li><li><p>Multiple product types (digital, physical, bundled).</p></li></ul><hr><h2>? Clean Up (Optional)</h2><p dir=\"ltr\">After testing:</p><ul><li><p>Turn <strong>Test Mode</strong> off.</p></li><li><p>Restore product prices if changed.</p></li></ul><hr><h2 dir=\"ltr\">\u2753Troubleshooting Tips</h2><ul><li><p><strong>Not receiving emails?</strong> Check notification settings under <strong dir=\"ltr\">Payments &gt; Settings &gt; Notifications.</strong></p></li><li><p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Checkout page not loading?</strong> Make sure your payment gateway is correctly set.</p></li></ul>\n\t"}, {"slug": "48001231670-why-are-my-calls-marked-as-spam-and-how-can-i-avoid-it", "title": "Why are my Calls marked as Spam and how can I avoid it", "folder": "LeadConnector Phone", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155050868458/original/r8cVIysfLerVMyT_YhT3c4ja4sjHxvd1uw7b19.png?1754297295", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155050868460/original/OddZgB6aRQ0406LEcExqBFsJkmH141QXKQf0e5.png?1754297297", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155050868812/original/NceJkOCO5cMRubQtLFcVldACOD750ZVu7gd3e2.png?1754297594", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155050868669/original/lmPxN5Jfa3o1ZARjMLl00oEwGnKGrRLM2wb4cf.png?1754297469"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 24px;\">Overview&nbsp;</span></strong></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; padding-top: 4px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">If your business calls are being flagged as 'Spam Likely' or 'Scam,' it can reduce answer rates and harm your credibility. This guide explains why calls are marked as spam and provides actionable steps to prevent it.</span></p><p><br></p><hr><p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><ul><li><a href=\"#Why-Are-Calls-Marked-as-Spam?\">Why Are Calls Marked as Spam?</a><ul><li><a href=\"#Common-Reasons-for-Spam-Labelling%3A\">Common Reasons for Spam Labelling:</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#Key-Impacts-of-Calls-Being-Marked-as-Spam\">Key Impacts of Calls Being Marked as Spam</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-to-Prevent-Your-Calls-from-Being-Marked-as-Spam\">How to Prevent Your Calls from Being Marked as Spam</a></li></ul><li><a href=\"#Why-Turn-On-Voice-Integrity?\">Why Turn On Voice Integrity?</a><ul><li><a href=\"#What-You-Need-to-Get-Started\">What You Need to Get Started</a></li><li><a href=\"#What-Happens-After-You-Register?\">What Happens After You Register?</a><ul><li><a href=\"#2.-Enable-SHAKEN/STIR-Authentication-(U.S.-Only)\">2. Enable SHAKEN/STIR Authentication (U.S. Only)</a></li><li><a href=\"#Note-%C2%A0An-EIN-(Employer-Identification-Number)-is-required-to-complete-SHAKEN/STIR-registration.%C2%A0If-you-don%E2%80%99t-have-an-EIN,-we-recommend-registering-your-number-with-the-Free-call-registry-instead.\">Note-&nbsp;An EIN (Employer Identification Number) is required to complete SHAKEN/STIR registration.&nbsp;If you don\u2019t have an EIN, we recommend registering your number with the Free call registry instead.</a></li><li><a href=\"#3.-Update-CNAM-(Caller-Name-Presentation)-Information\">3. Update CNAM (Caller Name Presentation) Information</a></li></ul></li><li><a href=\"#Frequently-Asked-Questions\">Frequently Asked Questions</a></li></ul></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"Why-Are-Calls-Marked-as-Spam?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\">Why Are Calls Marked as Spam?</span></strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">Carriers and mobile devices use algorithms to detect and flag suspicious calls. If your number is labeled as spam, customers may ignore or block your calls, impacting your business communication.</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><h3 id=\"Common-Reasons-for-Spam-Labelling:\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">Common Reasons for Spam Labelling:</span></strong></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><ul data-spread=\"false\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">High Call Volumes:</span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;Making too many calls in a short time can trigger spam filters.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Unfamiliar Numbers:</strong> Calls from numbers not recognized by the recipient or without proper caller ID.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Frequent Customer Complaints:</strong> If your number has been reported as spam multiple times.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Low Engagement Rates:</strong> If a high percentage of your calls go unanswered or are rejected.<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">SHAKEN/STIR Authentication Failures:</strong> If your caller ID isn\u2019t verified, it may be flagged.</span></p></li></ul><p><br></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></p><p><br></p><h2 id=\"Key-Impacts-of-Calls-Being-Marked-as-Spam\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 24px;\">Key Impacts of Calls Being Marked as Spam</span></strong></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\">When your business number is flagged, it can lead to:</span></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 14px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></p><ul data-spread=\"false\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-sty